Description: Use lo as the default listening interface
 We can't expect users to have an 'eth0' these days. Default to lo so
 that the service should be able to start until the user configures it.
Author: dann frazier <dannf@debian.org>
Last-Update: 2020-12-23

Index: flamethrower/etc/flamethrower.conf
===================================================================
--- etc/flamethrower.conf
+++ etc/flamethrower.conf
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ FLAMETHROWER_DIRECTORY_PORTBASE = 9000
 # The network interface on the Flamethrower server that used to send out
 # the data.
 #
-INTERFACE = eth0
+INTERFACE = lo
 
 # 
 # PERFORMANCE OPTION!
